@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g2-exemption`
IMPORT `g2-tests-fixtures`

-- g2-tests-exemption.l4: tests of section 7.  Expected values decided from the Hebrew of s 7(a), (b) and (c) before any module was run.

GIVEN electrician IS A BOOLEAN
      height IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN Applicant
`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` electrician `and a valid working-at-height approval` height MEANS
    Applicant WITH
        `the person` IS `the test person`
        `of full age` IS TRUE
        `an Israeli citizen` IS TRUE
        `an Israeli resident` IS TRUE
        `record of offences` IS `a clean record`
        `licences held` IS EMPTY
        `certificates held` IS EMPTY
        `registered as a certified technician in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
        `registered as a certified practical engineer in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
        `completed a study programme that includes the complement course` IS FALSE
        `registered as an engineer in the mechanical branch` IS FALSE
        `periods of work on cooling systems` IS EMPTY
        `holds a valid electrician licence of a kind listed in the Electricity Regulations` IS electrician
        `holds a valid working-at-height approval` IS height

§ `Tests — s 7(a) and (b): who may be exempted`

-- src:95 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית רשאי לתת לבעל רישיון חשמל בתוקף, פטור מלימודי פרק החשמל במסגרת הכשרה כאמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|בסעיף 6(א)(4)}}; לעניין זה, ”בעל רישיון חשמל“ – בעל רישיון המנוי {{ח:חיצוני|תקנות החשמל (רישיונות)#סעיף 7|בפסקאות (1) עד (7) לתקנה 7 בתקנות החשמל (רישיונות), התשמ״ה–1985}}.
-- src:96 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית רשאי לתת לבעל אישור עבודה בגובה בתוקף, פטור מלימודי פרק עבודה בגובה במסגרת הכשרה כאמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|בסעיף 6(א)(4)}}; לעניין זה, ”בעל אישור עבודה בגובה“ – בעל אישור המעיד כי קיבל הדרכה בעבודה בגובה כאמור {{ח:חיצוני|תקנות הבטיחות בעבודה (עבודה בגובה)#סעיף 5|בתקנות 5}} {{ח:חיצוני|תקנות הבטיחות בעבודה (עבודה בגובה)#סעיף 6|ו־6 לתקנות הבטיחות בעבודה (עבודה בגובה), התשס״ז–2007}}.
#ASSERT `s 7(a) — the applicant holds a valid electrician licence of a listed kind` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 7(a) — the applicant holds a valid electrician licence of a listed kind` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` FALSE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 7(b) — the applicant holds a valid working-at-height approval` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` FALSE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 7(b) — the applicant holds a valid working-at-height approval` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` FALSE)

-- The powers, exercised with #TRACE.  The holder of a valid electrician licence: the Director who exempts fulfils the rule; who does nothing leaves
-- the permission standing (a MAY is not a duty); an applicant who holds no such licence: no power arises.
#TRACE `s 7(a) — the Director may exempt the applicant from the electricity chapter of the training` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Director of the Training Division` DOES `exempt from the electricity chapter of the training` AT 4
#TRACE `s 7(a) — the Director may exempt the applicant from the electricity chapter of the training` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)
#TRACE `s 7(a) — the Director may exempt the applicant from the electricity chapter of the training` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` FALSE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)
#TRACE `s 7(b) — the Director may exempt the applicant from the working-at-height chapter of the training` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` FALSE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Director of the Training Division` DOES `exempt from the working-at-height chapter of the training` AT 4
#TRACE `s 7(b) — the Director may exempt the applicant from the working-at-height chapter of the training` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)

§ `Tests — what an exemption that was given covers`

-- The Law gives no hours for a chapter, so only the chapters are reported; a chapter is covered where the Director gave the exemption AND s 7 allows it for this applicant.
#ASSERT `s 7 — the chapters of the training the applicant is exempt from` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS LIST `the electricity chapter`, `the working-at-height chapter`
#ASSERT `s 7 — the chapters of the training the applicant is exempt from` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS LIST `the electricity chapter`
#ASSERT `s 7 — the chapters of the training the applicant is exempt from` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS LIST `the working-at-height chapter`
#ASSERT `s 7 — the chapters of the training the applicant is exempt from` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` TRUE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS EMPTY
-- Given but not allowed: an exemption from the electricity chapter for an applicant with no valid electrician licence is not an exemption s 7 allows.
#ASSERT `s 7 — the chapters of the training the applicant is exempt from` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` FALSE `and a valid working-at-height approval` TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS LIST `the working-at-height chapter`
#ASSERT `s 7 — the chapters of the training the applicant is exempt from` (`an applicant who holds a valid electrician licence` FALSE `and a valid working-at-height approval` FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS EMPTY

§ `Tests — s 7(c): the duty to publish`

-- src:97 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית יפרסם באתר האינטרנט של המשרד הוראות בדבר אופן הגשת הבקשה לפטור לפי סעיף זה, והמסמכים שיש לצרף לה.
-- The Director who publishes fulfils the duty; with nothing done the duty stands (the section states no period, so no breach arises).
#TRACE `s 7(c) — the Director must publish the instructions for applying for an exemption` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Director of the Training Division` DOES `publish the instructions for applying for an exemption` AT 30
#TRACE `s 7(c) — the Director must publish the instructions for applying for an exemption` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 4000)
